      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STAR NOTE (6) produced a dazzling 29.66 win over 525m at this track last start. In form and looks the one to beat again. SUNNY LYN (3) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 3 lengths at this track in a handy 30.07 beating KISS FOR CASH. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Bold showing expected again. KISS FOR CASH (8) recorded her best time this course and distance latest, finishing a 0.6 lengths second behind Xara's Keith in 30.19. Top run latest and can measure up here. IRISH ZOE (1) placed last time out so worth considering.",
